      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "Six articles were excluded as they were not RCTs: three meta-analyses[17, 25, 26] and three reviews. A total of 19 studies with mixed interventions did not meet our inclusion criteria and were excluded...",
      "reason": "The retrieved evidence describes exclusions based on study design (not RCTs) and mixed interventions not meeting inclusion criteria, but does not indicate any exclusion distinction between “outcomes not measured” vs “outcome results not reported.” Therefore, this conditional reporting requirement does not apply based on the available evidence."
