      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "The participants were randomly assigned to acupuncture group or control group... Eleven studies compared acupuncture with other/no interventions... In addition, five studies[51, 54, 56 - 58] compared the efficacy of acupuncture plus drug therapy against drug therapy.",
      "reason": "The evidence identifies comparison group types used in the included studies (acupuncture vs control; acupuncture plus drug therapy vs drug therapy). However, it does not explicitly describe the exact groups used in each synthesis and how they map to comparisons defined in the review objectives."
    },
